    <string name="about_content">TourMate BD is your trusted travel companion for exploring the beautiful tourist destinations of Bangladesh.\n\nOur mission is to empower tourists with accurate, honest information to navigate destinations independently — without falling victim to local syndicates, overcharging, or misinformation.\n\nCurrently featuring: Sylhet Division (complete)\n\nMore divisions coming soon!</string>
